# Read-only snapshot query. kind: targets or obstacles. <=0 range means all.
string kind
float32 range_limit
---
uint8 NOT_READY=0
uint8 VALID=1
uint8 STALE=2
uint8 INVALID=3
uint8 UNSUPPORTED=4
uint8 status
string message
string source_topic
builtin_interfaces/Time observed_at
float64 age_sec
Target3DArray targets
ObstacleInfoArray obstacles
